            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments of this disclosure disclose a method for data security check and apparatus in an integrated circuit, and a medium. The method includes: determining, according to an address corresponding to a write pointer, a first address segment in which a first set of data is written into a first memory located in the integrated circuit; storing the first set of data into a storage space of the first address segment in the first memory; determining target encoded data based on the first set of data; storing the target encoded data into a second memory located in the integrated circuit, where the first memory is different from the second memory; and performing, based on the target encoded data, security check on a second set of data that is read from the first memory.</p>
            </abstract>
